{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"理查德·费曼·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"richard-feynman","categoryLabel":"理查德·费曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/31_richard-feynman/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"理查德-费曼-生平与时代\">理查德·费曼·生平与时代</h1><p>理查德·费曼（Richard Feynman，1918—1988）是二十世纪最富传奇色彩的物理学家之一。他既是量子电动力学（QED）的奠基者、1965 年诺贝尔奖得主，又是一位敲邦戈鼓、撬保险箱、画素描的&quot;科学顽童&quot;；他以最深刻的物理洞见著称，又以最朴素的方式向大众讲解科学，并在 1986 年挑战者号事故调查中以一杯冰水揭示真相。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷的定位-生平-vs-其他姊妹卷\">本卷的定位：生平 vs 其他姊妹卷</h2><p>本卷（<strong>生平与时代</strong>）沿<strong>时间脉络</strong>讲述费曼&quot;做了什么、经历了什么&quot;——童年、求学、曼哈顿计划、学术生涯、成名与谢幕。它是理解整个费曼知识库的<strong>时间骨架与入口</strong>。其余五卷按主题切分，与本卷分工如下，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>姊妹卷</th>\n<th>它回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>QED、费曼图、路径积分、部分子等<strong>科学成果本身</strong></td>\n<td>本卷只交代成果产生的时间与处境，技术细节归该卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">理念与方法</a></td>\n<td>费曼学习法、第一性原理、科学诚实等<strong>思想方法</strong></td>\n<td>本卷指出其人生源头，方法论展开归该卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>《讲义》《别闹了》等<strong>著作的内容与评价</strong></td>\n<td>本卷交代出版背景，文本分析归该卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>对后世科学、教育、文化的<strong>长期影响</strong></td>\n<td>本卷止于 1988，身后影响归该卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>性别争议、自我神话化等<strong>批评与再评价</strong></td>\n<td>本卷诚实点出争议，系统辨析归该卷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[本卷·生平与时代&lt;br/&gt;建立时间骨架] --&gt; B[核心贡献&lt;br/&gt;科学成果]&#10;  A --&gt; C[理念与方法&lt;br/&gt;思想方法]&#10;  B --&gt; D[主要著作]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[影响与遗产]&#10;  A --&gt; F[争议与评价]\">flowchart LR\n  A[本卷·生平与时代&lt;br/&gt;建立时间骨架] --&gt; B[核心贡献&lt;br/&gt;科学成果]\n  A --&gt; C[理念与方法&lt;br/&gt;思想方法]\n  B --&gt; D[主要著作]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[影响与遗产]\n  A --&gt; F[争议与评价]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>零基础读者</strong>：先通读本卷六篇，建立时间线，再按兴趣进入姊妹卷。</li>\n<li><strong>物理背景读者</strong>：可快速浏览本卷，直接深入 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>教育/科普兴趣读者</strong>：本卷 + <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">理念与方法</a> + <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：本卷无硬性前置；涉及 QED、路径积分处仅作背景提及，深入需配合 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷章节\">本卷章节</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>早年与教育</strong>——<a href=\"early-life-and-education/far-rockaway-childhood-and-mit\">童年与 MIT</a>（1918—1939）、<a href=\"early-life-and-education/princeton-and-the-loss-of-arline\">普林斯顿与痛失阿琳</a>（1939—1945）</li>\n<li><strong>曼哈顿计划与学术生涯</strong>——<a href=\"manhattan-project-and-academia/los-alamos-years\">洛斯阿拉莫斯岁月</a>（1943—1946）、<a href=\"manhattan-project-and-academia/cornell-and-caltech\">康奈尔与加州理工</a>（1945—1988）</li>\n<li><strong>公众声名与最后岁月</strong>——<a href=\"public-fame-and-final-years/nobel-prize-and-celebrity\">诺贝尔奖与公众偶像</a>（1965 起）、<a href=\"public-fame-and-final-years/challenger-and-final-years\">挑战者号调查与最后岁月</a>（1986—1988）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>费曼传记之所以迷人，在于他打破了&quot;伟大科学家&quot;的刻板形象：他严肃于物理，却游戏于人生；追求最深的真理，又拒绝一切故弄玄虚。本卷力求以平实而立体的笔触，还原一个真实的费曼——连同他的天才、挣扎与时代局限。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-education","title":"早年与求学","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/early-life-and-education","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"far-rockaway-childhood-and-mit","title":"法洛克威的童年与麻省理工","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/early-life-and-education/far-rockaway-childhood-and-mit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"princeton-and-the-loss-of-arline","title":"普林斯顿与痛失阿琳","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/early-life-and-education/princeton-and-the-loss-of-arline"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"manhattan-project-and-academia","title":"曼哈顿计划与学术生涯","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/manhattan-project-and-academia","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"los-alamos-years","title":"洛斯阿拉莫斯岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/manhattan-project-and-academia/los-alamos-years"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cornell-and-caltech","title":"康奈尔与加州理工","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/manhattan-project-and-academia/cornell-and-caltech"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-fame-and-final-years","title":"公众声名与晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/public-fame-and-final-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nobel-prize-and-celebrity","title":"诺贝尔奖与公众偶像","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/public-fame-and-final-years/nobel-prize-and-celebrity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"challenger-and-final-years","title":"挑战者号调查与最后岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/life-and-times/public-fame-and-final-years/challenger-and-final-years"}]}]}